                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c95ca588-9b4e-3831-879f-64e5a6e83fdc",
                        "entry_id": "027e91a9-f377-3716-aa5b-cbd7a56e0385",
                        "glosses": [
                            "unabhängiger Staat innerhalb des Stadtgebiets von Rom in Italien"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bae6afe-640a-4232-9104-e19991b57da6",
                                "sense_id": "c95ca588-9b4e-3831-879f-64e5a6e83fdc",
                                "text": "Das Staatsoberhaupt der Vatikanstadt ist der jeweils amtierende Papst."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33a7350d-fba8-4d85-b08b-05c014511cbc",
                                "sense_id": "c95ca588-9b4e-3831-879f-64e5a6e83fdc",
                                "text": "„Die Zufahrt zur Vatikanstadt ist durch ein großes Tor von Rom getrennt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3709cadf-0108-4f08-8353-6c97c78cc45e",
                        "source_entry_id": "027e91a9-f377-3716-aa5b-cbd7a56e0385",
                        "source_sense_id": "c95ca588-9b4e-3831-879f-64e5a6e83fdc",
                        "source_sense_description": "unabhängiger Staat innerhalb des Stadtgebiets von Rom in Italien",
                        "target_lang_word": "Vatican City",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Vatican City",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c1f0933-498c-3d68-b4f4-20f5d37feba8",
                                        "entry_id": "722230c0-2eb0-3776-8fcd-a1feb2c6d1b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A city-state in Southern Europe, an enclave within the city of Rome, Italy. Official name: Vatican City State."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1695522-abfe-47f4-84ed-8bb4f78a1841",
                                                "sense_id": "9c1f0933-498c-3d68-b4f4-20f5d37feba8",
                                                "text": "“The new State, which will be known as the Vatican City, has a tiny territory,” the Pope [Pius XI] said, “but it is the greatest in the world because it contains Bernig’s^([sic]) colonnades, Michelangelo’s dome, treasures of art in the Vatican library, museums and galleries, and because, above all, it contains the tomb of the Prince of the Apostles. No more precious territory exists.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed324b1a-47a6-4d1b-a9c3-d5f9d5b3f344",
                                                "sense_id": "9c1f0933-498c-3d68-b4f4-20f5d37feba8",
                                                "text": "Unlike most other countries in the world, citizenship in Vatican City isn’t solely provided to people that are born in the country. As there are no hospitals in the Vatican State, virtually no one is born in there. Instead, Vatican citizenship is provided on a ‘jus officii’ basis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9338b9a3-5b28-404b-af37-4ad6067c28a1",
                                                "sense_id": "9c1f0933-498c-3d68-b4f4-20f5d37feba8",
                                                "text": "The advisory mentions “travel to the Vatican City,” but did not specify if he would meet with the pope."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "23bf43f3-aaf6-4c15-a1db-9c175d5caa4b",
                        "source_entry_id": "027e91a9-f377-3716-aa5b-cbd7a56e0385",
                        "source_sense_id": "c95ca588-9b4e-3831-879f-64e5a6e83fdc",
                        "source_sense_description": "unabhängiger Staat innerhalb des Stadtgebiets von Rom in Italien",
                        "target_lang_word": "Vatican",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Vatican",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b04cb849-c352-3be7-827b-3a0cb004fbaf",
                                        "entry_id": "8a5ec8d2-2033-3314-9c49-0d1a5025e502",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ancienne colline de Rome, voisine du Janicule, située près du Tibre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "277b4f80-cba2-43bc-a896-61d5bcbc9037",
                                                "sense_id": "b04cb849-c352-3be7-827b-3a0cb004fbaf",
                                                "text": "La basilique Saint-Pierre est bâtie sur le Vatican."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7644191c-e0df-3cbf-999a-28865cf1ba95",
                                        "entry_id": "8a5ec8d2-2033-3314-9c49-0d1a5025e502",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit État enclavé en Italie, représentant la religion catholique du point de vue temporel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Pays"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db6c205c-9f2a-4331-9476-5e20c756f5de",
                                                "sense_id": "7644191c-e0df-3cbf-999a-28865cf1ba95",
                                                "text": "Les rapports avec le Vatican."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbfd6946-4fbc-481f-acea-cf4ca5690fa8",
                                                "sense_id": "7644191c-e0df-3cbf-999a-28865cf1ba95",
                                                "text": "La Marquise. – Comme il tremblerait, ce vieux du Vatican, si tu ouvrais tes ailes, toi, mon aiglon !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7e6dd36-9e88-312d-867d-bb77ecdc1ca9",
                                        "entry_id": "8a5ec8d2-2033-3314-9c49-0d1a5025e502",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Haute hiérarchie de l’Église catholique romaine qui siège dans cet état."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45630741-62e9-4af3-82aa-e33147e78dbe",
                                                "sense_id": "c7e6dd36-9e88-312d-867d-bb77ecdc1ca9",
                                                "text": "Les foudres du Vatican, les bulles d’excommunication, les interdits, etc., lancés par le pape."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7d6f944-6cce-4944-ac74-cecc7ce772fd",
                                                "sense_id": "c7e6dd36-9e88-312d-867d-bb77ecdc1ca9",
                                                "text": "En décembre dernier, la perspective d’un accord semblait s’éloigner, mais le Vatican a marqué une très ferme volonté d’aboutir. Dès mardi, quelques vaticanistes affirmaient que l’accord était acquis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c9e6446-36ed-4de9-9017-f61e01f19270",
                                                "sense_id": "c7e6dd36-9e88-312d-867d-bb77ecdc1ca9",
                                                "text": "Attention, un train peut en cacher un autre ! Derrière l’expression « le Vatican », on vise souvent plusieurs réalités distinctes : l’État de la Cité du Vatican, le Saint-Siège, le pape, la curie romaine et ses dicastères, l’Église catholique, ou un Concile œcuménique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
